          "note": "US version",
          "author": "Viacom",
          "description": "Let's bow wow build! Join Rubble and his family as they quickly become the heroes of Builder Cove. From building a dinosaur museum tall enough to fit a T-Rex skeleton, to a waterway to help Farmer Zoe grow her vegetables, to a super car wash to make Mayor Greatway’s motorcycle squeaky clean for the Vroom-Vroom Road Race, the construction pups work together to get the job done!\n\nStories include:\nThe Crew Builds a Bridge\nThe Crew Builds a Car Wash\nThe Crew Builds a Dinosaur Museum\nThe Crew Builds a Waterway\nThe Crew Builds a Wheelchair Ramp",
